msgstr ""

#: doc/en/get-started.md:131
msgid "Select **Computed column** and enter a MoonScript or Lua expression."
msgstr ""

#: doc/en/get-started.md:132
msgid "The formula is the body of a function `(self, space) -> <expression>`; in MoonScript `@field` accesses `self.field`. The value is recomputed on each read and is not stored."
msgstr ""

#: doc/en/get-started.md:134
msgid "**Example: `nom_complet` in `auteurs`** — combine first name, particle and last name while handling nulls:"
msgstr ""

#: doc/en/get-started.md:136 doc/en/get-started.md:146 doc/en/get-started.md:161 doc/en/reference.md:143 doc/en/reference.md:157 doc/en/reference.md:175 doc/en/reference.md:201
